%%body
{
  A message appears on your HUD, as per usual you open it to Nori's usual check-in.

    @ Nori "I have news."

  News, just news?

    @ Nori "The Radio Tower picked up another unusual signal, normally Harmonia's surface is stable."

  Yeah, normally, except since you arrived.

    @ Nori "Precisely, ever since you've appeared the world has been progressing, it's both a good and ominous situation, but I thought you'd like to know this time as it involves magic, wooden golems have been appearing."

  Golems?

    @ Nori "Don't get your hopes up, they're small, not particularly strong at the moment, but I figured you'd want to know about that."

  You were curious and took your new steel tools along to investigate.
}
%date 2026-08-15
